== model-level controls (S5-concurrent)
   ok   mark, restore, forward: the entry after the marked one: pass (want pass)
   ok   restore one entry too far: a stable entry skipped: FAIL (want FAIL)
   ok   restore that lost the mark: from the start again: FAIL (want FAIL)
   ok   the stable marked entry returned again after restore: FAIL (want FAIL)
   ok   an inserted entry returned after restore: pass (want pass)
   ok   mark in a gap, restore, forward: the next stable entry: pass (want pass)
   ok   end of the pass right after restore, stable entries left: FAIL (want FAIL)
   ok   removal right after the mark: the removed entry skipped after restore: pass (want pass)
   ok   removal right after the mark: the removed entry returned in its place: pass (want pass)
   ok   marked entry removed: restore, forward gives the next stable entry: pass (want pass)
   ok   marked entry removed: a stable entry before the mark after restore: FAIL (want FAIL)
   ok   marked entry removed: returned again right after restore: DOMAIN (want DOMAIN)
   ok   marked entry deleted, still in the index: returned again after restore: FAIL (want FAIL)
